\title{bauhaus: 'ggplot2' Themes from the Bauhaus Clock Screensaver Dials}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

Sixteen 'ggplot2' themes, one for each day dial of the Bauhaus Clock screensaver. Each theme paints the plot on the dial's paper plate, complete with the screensaver's fine paper grain, sets type in the screensaver's typeface (Zalando Sans Expanded, bundled), and takes its text, grid, geom and palette colours from the dial's measured inks, steel, lume and shadow tints. Matching discrete, continuous and binned colour scales are included.
